                    "#*Depending on your plan, you may want to also add room dividers or supplementary knee walls to your attic space. If there are any internal walls going up, [[Frame a Wall|frame them]] after installing the sub-floor, now that you've got a surface to build upon. If you want flat walls as opposed to the sloped walls you'll get in most attics, it would be appropriate to install a few knee walls."
