            "contribution_type": "addition",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#Lay a sub-floor, if necessary. Most attics will need a sub-floor to be laid that you can build on top of. Cut sub-floor panels to the appropriate size and install them over the joist beams. Screw down into joists at {{convert|3|ft|m|adj=on|sigfig=2}} (91.44 cm) intervals using wood screws.[[Image:Finish an Attic Step 2.jpg|center]]"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Lay a sub-floor, if necessary. Most attics will need a sub-floor to be laid that you can build on top of. Cut sub-floor panels to the appropriate size and install them over the joist beams. Screw down into joists at 3 foot (91.44 cm) intervals using wood screws.[[Image:Finish an Attic Step 2.jpg|center]]"
                ]
            }
        },
